window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It's time to pay the piper....</p> <p>Tanis Richards has had enough with people manipulating her; unfortunately, the only way out is to go through.</p> <p>Her mission takes her to Earth to abduct a high-ranking Scattered Disk officer on the orders of the Jovian Oligarch. Meanwhile, Harm must do the unthinkable to escape his captor and come to Tanis' aid.</p> <p>Tanis doesn't know it yet, but if she doesn't succeed, her failure will spark the third Solar War....</p>"; 
